# LINK - Link relocatable object modules

```text
B0:LINK output=module[,module...][A]
```

## Link one module

```text
B0:LINK PROGRAM[A]
```

Run this from the work disk containing PROGRAM.REL. The [A] option
requests an absolute COM file. Use [ZSM4](ZSM4.HLP) to assemble a .MAC
source into a .REL module.

## Several modules

```text
B0:LINK CHECK=MAIN,PART[A]
```

This links MAIN.REL and PART.REL into CHECK.COM. Look for undefined
symbols before running it. For checked output and a saved report, use
[DLINK](DLINK.HLP).
